{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Aa jaan-e-jaan' [Dm]Aa jaan-e-jaan,        [F]Aa meraa ye husn
[Gm]javaan, [A#]javaan, [C]javaan,        [C]Tere [Gm]liye hai aas [F]lagaaye
